# The Worldgorger Dragon ruling (CR 607.2a, 603.6c): Bot1 animates the Dragon; with its enters ability on the stack, Bot2
# Swords to Plowshares it. Its leaves ability triggers, resolves first and returns nothing - nothing has been exiled with
# it yet - and Animate Dead, enchanting nothing, goes to the graveyard (CR 704.5m). Then the enters ability resolves and
# exiles all other permanents Bot1 controls, both Swamps, for good. Bot1 gains 6 life, the Dragon's power as it was
# exiled (7, less Animate Dead's 1).

